#: scenario7:scenario7_098F4217_8979_438E_B106_8463B303EA57
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: efe40139059aa1ade10aae1e4377d86b379cbd9cc54e6abbe21297ba130519fd
#. default-sha256: 52cf855f262519d21560bdae5382650c1a70c10d9ed32bc4a056879e52fe813c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_098F4217_8979_438E_B106_8463B303EA57"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Reality fades back into view."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫――다시금 ⟪k:1⟫눈앞에 현실이 나타났다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CDE966D8_424B_449D_BDB0_A302D8A9E8BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7220c1d07d50f8707c3bbe4d04801f803b44906c87110a6595e0128de5358a86
#. default-sha256: da0bd2da5a1eb7a7005c20e445ef2e9517262c950d27316000cced4f4c1f0a30
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CDE966D8_424B_449D_BDB0_A302D8A9E8BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m looking at neither the endless, eroding darkness, nor the visions of my past, ⟪k:1⟫but "
"the sea of blood spreading in all directions."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그곳은 ⟪k:1⟫나를 좀먹던 어둠과 ⟪k:2⟫내 과거가 아닌――⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫피바다가 펼쳐진 저택 안이었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0B7E335C_F700_46DA_B344_D99D126704A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 495c4be0bb91eb77d91590095434b87d43160b56b264f621ed4f96ae496e23d6
#. default-sha256: cebff22e9bc1245166a0daeb83d1b34cb49861b5ec95f15d3a77f2157c87dc22
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0B7E335C_F700_46DA_B344_D99D126704A6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m standing at the top of the observation tower, outside the door.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’ve returned."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 감시탑 최상층…… 그 문 앞까지,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫다시―― ⟪k:3⟫돌아왔다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B13FC8E8_7690_47F3_BF80_04E6CEA3F9A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28d1f15123d7d1bc7dcafd4e8c87f120d87944889c50a2ab6a3a66c35f6146ee
#. default-sha256: 5dd1eae21562c67fdb2f8a9d92761765022875b9feace8e16685aa20990ffa69
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B13FC8E8_7690_47F3_BF80_04E6CEA3F9A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Back in Morgana’s world—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫her bitter, hate-filled, curse-fueled world."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫모르가나의 증오와 ⟪k:1⟫저주, ⟪k:2⟫악의가 넘실거리는―― 이 세계로."

#: scenario7:scenario7_368C5D2A_599F_4CB2_B091_B47F140C350E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a509bb562a0a484b9c1c634f2b3f99d2aeb2b1632d86bf9890400896b25bdc75
