msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C868D4F1_2DC3_4B08_B4FB_216653ABEDDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c94552c65477401680fdf14068362dc240067ea9cc931afeb963e02296ef2ece
#. default-sha256: ffc05588bf58bebc2ac8d09170e0082668bd231ec61abb9e034f119f8637e848
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C868D4F1_2DC3_4B08_B4FB_216653ABEDDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is my mansion. ⟪k:1⟫My domain.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫She was ⟪k:4⟫supposed⟪k:5⟫ to be locked up,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫여긴 저의 저택……, ⟪k:1⟫저의 세계.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫지젤의 혼은 우리에 가두었을 텐데――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2B1306B5_E4DA_499A_A661_6936ECC0D8BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 372ddfa83b9bbf09283cd2e4f315796bb4baebe003547dfba80b95c29211998b
#. default-sha256: 138a2c3c20f01bb5da47970eb7b47e3b2331c8da0065dcb84502c5ffb29bbaf9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2B1306B5_E4DA_499A_A661_6936ECC0D8BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but it would seem my will is not as absolute as I had thought."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아주 마음대로 구는걸요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_693D17D2_4D59_444F_8262_01C1D36A1DE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e5f076200f6983ca4ca0fc1c691a6e6453f8401704e51b9b61a3ac777432ce7
#. default-sha256: 58fe3a165dfde6880479368cee39a2fe9664683f9a6f204acd5e2f36a93430b6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_693D17D2_4D59_444F_8262_01C1D36A1DE5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What would you call that—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the “power of love”?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Is ⟪k:5⟫that⟪k:6⟫ what "
"allowed this to happen?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫How trite. ⟪k:9⟫Where’s the magic—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫the ⟪k:12⟫"
"miracle⟪k:13⟫?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소위…… “사랑의 힘”이라 이건가요?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫징글맞네요…… 시답잖아요. ⟪k:3⟫거룩하지도 않아요……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F3C512D5_E7E8_4CB7_93AA_FEA88B7186C6
