#: scenario7:scenario7_34F17C4C_ACA6_4B21_B395_658CB898BFE3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2dd2cb1ca38be67a91f1aa22875cff28a1cb5936b4150275d4e1dc7e0835fa4
#. default-sha256: 6e7f867d214eb14edcfeb15c0cce49d0e8dbb6efe9dd114a631fe4d888321f57
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_34F17C4C_ACA6_4B21_B395_658CB898BFE3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I can think of one other reason she was able to escape."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……그게 다는…… ⟪k:1⟫아닐 거야. ⟪k:2⟫이유를 하나…… 들 수 있어.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그리고 바로 그 이유가 "
"⟪k:5⟫우리의 힘이 되어――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FA8BDA13_A7CB_4863_9F21_F72781AF6E5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c195caa2de291dde2a778917154063ba67d18ddceed135271634e85ceb8370c
#. default-sha256: 6b3b451813d682c34664b96f3d239aed29c7ab7c345b31891c36a580f20efc37
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FA8BDA13_A7CB_4863_9F21_F72781AF6E5A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it’s the only way we’ll be able to find the power we need to cast off the darkness of "
"this house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 어둠을 밝힐 ⟪k:1⟫유일한 방법이 될 거야."

#: scenario7:scenario7_69FDA528_F279_4D7B_93C3_EE3E12A62196
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc78b6ea18e1cb5883807e55264f59e521a00a84125ff69a16b1b4f4d9ea9be3
