msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_69FDA528_F279_4D7B_93C3_EE3E12A62196"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But first, before we do anything else,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만―― ⟪k:1⟫지금은 ⟪k:2⟫모든 것을 시작하기 전에……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F1C09B8D_6834_4F41_8769_C5092FF6B135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
