#: scenario7:scenario7_850595D6_C0F9_4F1D_8BCA_0C908B221FF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7811650e7e0d5e3351f5ca6748ef9740769f09c1ba7442d70a40ea729906210
#. default-sha256: 27c772d51983875aa75e86686f8678e7f7ae5418a0f4f1aaad8a334276007ff7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_850595D6_C0F9_4F1D_8BCA_0C908B221FF2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whatever nonsense that woman filled your head with,⟪k:1⟫it certainly seems to have put some "
"fight into those eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫무슨 소릴 들었는진 몰라도…… 표정이 많이 ⟪k:1⟫바뀌셨네요. ⟪k:2⟫여자 한 명이 위로한 거 가지고 "
"⟪k:3⟫신이 나셨군요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5E250B83_3019_4707_A6F5_7B56EC625D66
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddb416d5c4bcaedf01666f10611377aa8140ccda41076fa0266ed6af4cbeea26
#. default-sha256: f30706c9b8da3b3d2103e484b4279bb077eb7409a3d17de492e5814ed2a0a65d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5E250B83_3019_4707_A6F5_7B56EC625D66"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Well, good for you, my dear."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D3387E17_242B_4891_9DEB_F2FA0A2444A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38f19fc38339021693b34b0364c0db90bbafd9a4d18efc482057c03d7145a056
#. default-sha256: 6e26b26a3547032f902b2b541d89d04186cdf7344fa3fabd1f3a0230b2b4b4ff
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D3387E17_242B_4891_9DEB_F2FA0A2444A8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A little confidence boost doesn’t erase the fact that you were on the ground, crawling "
"through the filth like a worm, tears streaming down your face as you tried to ignore what lay "
"before you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫한심스럽게 기어다니며, ⟪k:1⟫눈물을 흘리고, ⟪k:2⟫외면하던 당신도 ⟪k:3⟫틀림없는 당신이에요. "
"⟪k:4⟫그 사실은 변치 않아요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4B954D95_FE33_4549_8EDC_D4C6B255F7BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f68a5a048f6eced56f49296564a0cce8489ee6a36dfcc6ae8860c05d227c751
