msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To tell you the truth... ⟪k:1⟫your constant chattering in the darkness... ⟪k:2⟫evoked more "
"than annoyance in me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네 말을 어둠 속에서 들을 때…… ⟪k:1⟫사실은 나도――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그게 남일 같지 않았어……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_86A6FCC3_196A_4053_9A69_97CEB67B05C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 318822f3d819c1229d9fc36f54fb94e41fae442d1bcb333f6023c53b96b2ced0
