#: scenario7:scenario7_29672F16_4DBB_4F6D_B257_2FF5F887FC83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd5cc643789015d40901c41c0250f20bf625370394a65556e4e5a67ca714ead3
