msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_29672F16_4DBB_4F6D_B257_2FF5F887FC83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was my despair that brought you back to life,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so that makes it my "
"responsibility to end this."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……내 절망이 ⟪k:3⟫너를 되살렸다면……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫나는 모든 걸 끝낼 책임이―― 있어."

#: scenario7:scenario7_188E107A_EF3F_47B9_9407_8F30878DA631
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0eed67e9c2ca242be8c96fdb81746fea694ca97f6a5425d330fb54a13b9a3372
