msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_188E107A_EF3F_47B9_9407_8F30878DA631"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My own wish has given me all the redemption I need, my dear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫저는 제 기도에 의해 ⟪k:2⟫진작에 구원받았어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫아니면 ⟪k:5⟫또 그 소린가요?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_051B510A_5B96_452C_B28C_FBC1D968A802
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f17283207099fc237e293c004a1475bd76edd05cad4b7662ae1a7ece07abb8d
#. default-sha256: 4d64d195bf224b3583d8de898ab9b2317f4c005f4a5fd0aaf01c9024e9a5f5ec
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_051B510A_5B96_452C_B28C_FBC1D968A802"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Or should I be expecting another self-righteous lecture about how “hatred does you no "
"good”?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫증오는 본인을 위한 게 아니란…… ⟪k:2⟫그 잘난 주장인가요?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_630BD0DE_F90E_44A7_9299_190B684C612D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a813659ed940ec5d538be3d62a21a88189914fb1a7b19e252f6b4d412857720
#. default-sha256: 7ceee9f840fa5157e85c4363c266e6fef37569a5091c17d614635d1e1b70036d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_630BD0DE_F90E_44A7_9299_190B684C612D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Brilliant, Michel. Brilliant.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do you have any idea how absurdly presumptuous "
"you’re being?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Trying to force your idea of redemption onto someone who has no interest "
"in it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫기가 막힌걸요, ⟪k:2⟫미셸…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫원하지도 않는 구원만큼 ⟪k:5⟫강압적이고―― 우스운 건 "
"없어요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_01448503_32F6_4FF0_8033_3BB6C8C239FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d424466ca44cb4186b28b86ce064f7e4df1b2cea7813051ed619f98dcf36318a
#. default-sha256: f9886fa0a0bea634ac3808a395db63871ca5caac5ddc2de6e8f133a37a1bb0e2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01448503_32F6_4FF0_8033_3BB6C8C239FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If the tale you showed me was the whole truth..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫만약 모든 진실이 ⟪k:3⟫네가 보여 준 과거와 똑같다면……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫그 자들의 비정함을 한"
"탄하고, ⟪k:6⟫증오하며――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D7064C1C_1266_459D_9946_229AE6683B85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55909443ab7f422ef0d73dfecc4a6ea16da72ede92336d66fbff8f9665f0171d
#. default-sha256: e6125bb4ef788c393b6cc8cc02c1afefbe06a070ca02efd88155ebc78d4d640d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D7064C1C_1266_459D_9946_229AE6683B85"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then I would have said you could revile those heartless men as much as you pleased."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫원 없이 ⟪k:1⟫저주하라 했을 거야."

#: scenario7:scenario7_80AEDE1A_E079_4F43_BF1F_DC7B5D439794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3aaae40ab051851b0310578b71d134cc7928b726b67aadb9a8382ac9bf5fc3b
#. default-sha256: 6f387872c8329392636251f18741fc53a2976242e1a0e628dfd868d5867e2721
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80AEDE1A_E079_4F43_BF1F_DC7B5D439794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I refuse to believe that’s the whole story.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The men I saw beyond the first "
"three doors had genuine concerns and worries."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 나는 ⟪k:1⟫그게 모든 진상 같지는 않아.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내가 본 문 안에서…… ⟪k:4⟫그 자들은 사람"
"으로서 고뇌하다가――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FFCB0458_489F_4DF1_AEF5_B943A99AE731
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fb819117d4b10d7484b81011c788f8e3d40c21b66fa43ac997a53f992fca75f
#. default-sha256: d0730b4a77dc8bd89dfaa1288a4f9a23bce3aa4d195ab394773e10817cf5371f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FFCB0458_489F_4DF1_AEF5_B943A99AE731"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They felt things—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫real, human emotions—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫even if those things ultimately "
"led them down a path of destruction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫끝내 파멸을 맞이하긴 했지만, ⟪k:1⟫그 과정에는 여러 감정이 존재했어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫남에게 선량하고 "
"싶은 마음――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CEC94C5E_2B7D_4088_BCB5_CE4948592495
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 085778587aac942367d7b8ea595c1277fcb2737553e65d87216a20ab3f78daf0
#. default-sha256: de2ffa2ca05a1cfaa4a4e337503659cac50eff7412590252a3d818bc9608d33a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CEC94C5E_2B7D_4088_BCB5_CE4948592495"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wanting to do something nice for the one you care about,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫being disgusted at things "
"you’ve done,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫hiding your urges from those around you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자기 자신에 대한 반발……, ⟪k:1⟫숨겨진 정."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6336FA3F_666E_4FAA_A8C4_DF72B409FE8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a9cb27112613728d4ad8985839a3cebe75a5a1309993d5b043371d55befdcb8
#. default-sha256: 00c9427b25f6bf02dcdcfd7fbfa1770663490c6fcb6e26f2f5c45dff0df46b78
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6336FA3F_666E_4FAA_A8C4_DF72B409FE8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You certainly couldn’t call them ⟪k:1⟫good⟪k:2⟫ men,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but they were real people with "
"real conflicts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫결코 ⟪k:1⟫선한 자로 단정할 수는 없지만……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그래도 그 자들은 ⟪k:4⟫매우 인간적인 갈등을 "
"품었어."

#: scenario7:scenario7_820226CB_A379_4EDB_AC2C_5046718D471D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d859057bc09c86f65582cc6c5242c79beba668236f4c62edffbcabc1a01edcf4
#. default-sha256: 2f0162d354bc6d1ec9c8c284b4923183f2624325892690663c3467587923e438
