msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...So you’re saying I’m lying?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……즉 ⟪k:2⟫제가 ⟪k:3⟫거짓말을 하는 거라고요?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0E88E04_7456_4076_8BFF_6E0903327CD8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 486a210033c701c76d35cd7e05e186326cd540f5492036b9e8c068916f14dfe4
