msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_999357EC_8687_425F_AEBC_7619F5A389E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You wouldn’t be here otherwise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇기에…… ⟪k:1⟫네가 여기 있는 거지."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4427F93C_6998_4CA4_A7A0_48A29D8C671C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
