msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I’ve learned something in my years...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“reality” exists from more than "
"one perspective."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫하지만 ⟪k:3⟫나는…… 내 인생을 통해 이해했어.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫진실은 ⟪k:6⟫결코 한 측면만으"
"로 볼 게 아니란 걸……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E9A67E66_6358_49E9_99D4_D41170DB11DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9beb2b7cc9ef6e18c3360491a6d154dc750c2ea512d703f3ba19ec72fb28331f
