msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E9A67E66_6358_49E9_99D4_D41170DB11DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That doesn’t change what happened. ⟪k:2⟫That two-faced young man deceived me, the beast "
"severed my arm,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫――일어난 사실에는 ⟪k:2⟫어떠한 변화도 없어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫위선자 청년이 저를 속인 사실, "
"⟪k:5⟫짐승이 제 팔을 절단한 사실,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3E6B0522_07E8_4613_8A05_B60AA2C61F44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8de4f18b0db64ceff38f9a89139c6cd150603cd5a0841a90e44b7c7472f2282
